## 13. H1 fix: applied after your approval, and re-verified (2026-11-07)

**Change (the only source change in Component 2.2 since the report):** `rpi3_mon_frame_store` in `rpi3_can_monitor.c` now copies through a `volatile uint8_t *` destination (3 lines added, 1 removed). Pre-change copy and hashes: `source_snapshots/optee_os_20261107_h1fix_pre/` (`SHA256SUMS` verified). New source hash prefix of `rpi3_can_monitor.c`: `74ecb2d270495775` (all other six files unchanged). `FINAL_DIFF.patch` regenerated (1,869 lines); the old one is kept as `FINAL_DIFF.patch.pre_h1fix`; the difference between them is exactly the intended lines.

